* class must have only concrete methods(non-abstract methods)
  but abstract class conatins both concrete and abstract methods.
* Declare an abstract method in abstract class and override that
  method in child class.
* abstract class should not have any object.
* abstract class and method created by abstract keyword
* override tha abstract method with public keyword in child class.
  Syntax:
         abstract class Parent{
		    -------
			//concrete method
			void display(){
              -----			
			}
			//abstract methods
			void show();
		 }
		 class Child extends Parent{
		   void printVal(){
		    ------
		   }
		   public void show(){
		    -------
		   }
		 } 